  "description": "A silvery beam of pale light shines down in a 5-foot-radius, 40-foot-high Cylinder centered on a point within range. Dim Light fills the Cylinder. When the Cylinder appears, each creature in it makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 2d10 Radiant damage on a failed save or half on success. A creature makes this save again when the spell's area moves into its space and when it enters the Cylinder or ends its turn there (once per turn).",
